{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:09 2026-05-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:09 2026-05-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:09 2026-05-19 HKT</p><p>油麻地街市發生斬人血案。今日（19日）早上11時32分，警方接獲炮台街油麻地街市一名男子報案，指他被一海鮮檔檔主持刀斬傷臉部。救護員到場，發現傷者面頰傷口長約兩厘米，血流披面，連忙將他送往廣華醫院治理。</p><p>警方以涉嫌傷人，當場拘捕一名海鮮檔男檔主，正調查事件原因。</p><img alt=\"現場是油麻地街市。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf399eea6652bd198abe918f6029efa0/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_124234468.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/177b9b97c4580ab577d12bc652e001a4/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_124234468_01.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e83c2c1d7d68e8a0c0d0100ca74698af/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_124234468_02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"事發於地下海鮮檔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e43f2d31445cb3e7250dcd4cd82d5ce/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_124234468_05.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b52a81963d6e53286a00406af40036e9/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_124234468_06.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/297b0e832d12c30d262f556f611fad25/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_124234468_07.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-19T05:53:53.265296+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}